{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_69","type":"agent_message","text":"\n\nAll 3 tests pass. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n**`replay/merge.py`** — Two bugs fixed:\n- `_event_key` now uses `event_id` for all event kinds (including `tool_output`). Previously it grouped by `(role, tool_name)`, collapsing distinct tool calls sharing the same name.\n- `merge_records` now drops `debug_only` fragments after `response.completed` instead of keeping them marked with `after_completion`.\n\n**`replay/incident_summary.py`** — Counts tool blocks directly from merged events (`count_source: \"merged_events\"`) instead of scanning rendered lines.\n\n**`reports/incidents/transcript-merge.md`** — Updated to document the resolution and supersede old mitigation guidance."}}
